{"dialogue": {"lines": [{"en": "Meera, has the report come?", "r": "Meera, report aayi?", "sp": "Boss", "t": "मीरा, रिपोर्ट आई?"}, {"en": "Yes sir. The file is on your table.", "r": "Ji sir. File aapki mez par hai.", "sp": "Meera", "t": "जी सर। फ़ाइल आपकी मेज़ पर है।"}, {"en": "Good. Take a print of it.", "r": "Achha. Iska print nikaalo.", "sp": "Boss", "t": "अच्छा। इसका प्रिंट निकालो।"}, {"en": "Okay sir. Anything else?", "r": "Theek hai sir. Aur kuch?", "sp": "Meera", "t": "ठीक है सर। और कुछ?"}], "title": "In the office"}, "lede": "Staff, stationery and the daily commute — Hindi for working life.", "phrases": [{"en": "arrive on time", "r": "samay par aaiye", "t": "समय पर आइए"}, {"en": "I need leave tomorrow", "r": "kal mujhe chhutti chaahiye", "t": "कल मुझे छुट्टी चाहिए"}, {"en": "the work is done", "r": "kaam khatm hua", "t": "काम ख़त्म हुआ"}, {"en": "send the email", "r": "email bhejie", "t": "ईमेल भेजिए"}, {"en": "well done!", "r": "shaabaash!", "t": "शाबाश!"}, {"en": "come to the meeting", "r": "meeting mein aaiye", "t": "मीटिंग में आइए"}, {"en": "sign here", "r": "yahaan dastakhat kijiye", "t": "यहाँ दस्तख़त कीजिए"}, {"en": "take a copy", "r": "ek naqal le lijiye", "t": "एक नक़ल ले लीजिए"}, {"en": "wait a little", "r": "thoda intezaar kijiye", "t": "थोड़ा इंतज़ार कीजिए"}, {"en": "come tomorrow", "r": "kal aaiye", "t": "कल आइए"}, {"en": "any question?", "r": "koi sawaal?", "t": "कोई सवाल?"}, {"en": "sorry for the delay", "r": "deri ke liye maaf kijiye", "t": "देरी के लिए माफ़ कीजिए"}], "quiz": [{"a": "salary", "explain": "वेतन (vetan) = salary; दिहाड़ी = daily wages.", "id": "hi-35", "lesson": "hindi/advanced/office", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["salary", "bonus", "loan", "bill"], "q": "वेतन means…", "topic": "office", "type": "vocab"}, {"a": "कंप्यूटर", "explain": "कंप्यूटर = computer.", "id": "hi-36", "lesson": "hindi/advanced/office", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["कंप्यूटर", "लैपटॉप", "टेलीफ़ोन", "प्रिंटर"], "q": "Which is 'computer'?", "topic": "office"